Package: euaiact
Type: Package
Title: Offline Calculation and Logic Rules for the EU Artificial Intelligence Act
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", email = "riskdatascience@web.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "Dr."),
    person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = "cph"))
Description: Native offline evaluation of explicit calculation and logic rules
    for documented versions of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act. Supports
    German identifiers, unknown facts and traceable decisions. Explicitly bounded
    rule catalogue; evaluation of a factual condition is not a conformity assessment.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: de
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats
URL: https://riskdatascience.net
